{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54463","headline":"兵要望江南 委任第一（京本作「占委任第一」二十六首） 九 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 委任第一（京本作「占委任第一」二十六首） 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"觇彼势，虚实要先评。\n兵有正奇将胜败（京本作「关将敏」），有（京本作「势」）无强弱在军精（辛本作「情」），料敌不须惊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54463.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54463","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}